Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 09:40:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 46/47] MTROPOLIS: Add a hack for the name screen arrow keys of
 Uncle Albert's Fabulous Voyage
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The name screen says to pick a saved player with the up and down arrows
("flèches haut et bas"), but only its on-screen arrow buttons respond:
there is no keyboard messenger for the arrow keys, so players who used
the keyboard could not find their saved game.

Add a hack that makes a key press click an element of a scene (Mouse
Down, Mouse Up, Mouse Up Inside), and use it for the up and down keys on
the name screen ("bouton_haut" and "bouton_bas" of "liste_nom").

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
